//   No per person oxygen figure. Halcyon's cargo carries seed stock and nutrient salts (stated in f14s6), so Bay D restarts after arrival.
// MONEY: no spend is stated. The press camera's cost isn't stated.
// THE CRITERIA (every path; set at the board's working session Wed Jan 3 and in writing after it; published Fri Jan 12 at noon): test Tue Jan 30
//   at 2:00 PM MST after a cold soak from 4:00 PM Mon Jan 29; five commanded closes of MOIV-1 with the conditioning cycle; MOIV-2 commanded
