// THE TEST (every path; the closing): soak 22 hours. Closes 1, 2, 4, 5: disagreement under 1 ms, pressure confirms closed within 31 ms, no ripple.
//   Close 3: the ripple begins 2 ms after lift, position disagrees for 12 ms (inside C1's 15, above the 10 ms ground acceptance limit), pressure
