//   4 days late. SPI($) = 236 / 284 = 0.83. Test critical points left 41 (on plan); other 123.
// SCORING DRILL: October checkout's 40 ms is 2.67 times C1's 15; the December ground set's worst pressure confirm 31 ms is 62 percent of 50; the
