  // FLAGS: ch14 sets none (the bible's flags table lists none for it) and doesn't read rosylog. It reads trustedai (f14s3), r_reserve (f14s3),
  //   crashedtest and r_protectedtest (f14s1), skippedwendell (f14s4), cutregression (f14s7), r_testarticle (f14s8, closing), and exposedada
